  (text "RXV00 - EXPRESSLRS 2.4 GHz RECEIVER\nFirmware: ELRS Unified_ESP32C3_2400_RX, upload RXV00_hardware.json (in this folder) as hardware layout.\nFirst flash: USB pads (GPIO18/19, ESP32-C3 native USB) or UART pads with BOOT (GPIO9) held low.\nLater updates: WiFi or Betaflight passthrough.\nRF matching component values are START VALUES - tune with a VNA (SX1281 PA / LNA_IN of ESP32-C3).\n" (at 180 20 0)
